  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5254,
      "text": "Whether you speak secretly or openly, He is All-Knowing of that which is in the hearts.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5255,
      "text": "Does He not know His Own creation[4], when He is the Most Subtle, the All-Aware?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5256,
      "text": "It is He Who made the earth smooth[5] for you, so travel through its regions and eat from His provisions. And to Him is the resurrection.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5257,
      "text": "Do you feel secure that He Who is above heaven will not cause the earth to sink with you, and then suddenly convulse[6]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5258,
      "text": "Do you feel secure that He Who is in heaven will not send against you a storm of stones? Only then would you know how [serious] My warning was!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5259,
      "text": "Those who came before them rejected [the messengers]; then how severe was My response!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5260,
      "text": "Do they not see the birds above them, spreading out and folding in their wings? None holds them up except the Most Compassionate. He is indeed All-Seeing of everything.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5261,
      "text": "Which is your army that can come to your aid against the Most Compassionate? The disbelievers are in utter delusion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5262,
      "text": "Who is there to give you provision if He withholds His provision? Yet they persist in arrogance and aversion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5263,
      "text": "Who is better guided: the one who walks stumbling and falling on his face or the one who walks upright on a straight path?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5264,
      "text": "Say, “It is He Who brought you into being and gave you hearing, sight, and hearts; little do you give thanks.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5265,
      "text": "Say, “It is He Who has dispersed you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5266,
      "text": "They say: “When will this promise come to pass, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5267,
      "text": "Say, “That knowledge is with Allah alone, and I am only a clear warner.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 563,
      "ruku": 497,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
